      "created_at": "2013-04-26T14:33:24.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So La Capitan&nbsp;<em>loves&nbsp;</em>Imbued Vitality: it allows her to hit with Maria Helena's Revenge when her ongoings (or Imbued Vitality itself) is destroyed, and it allows her to destroy and store Ongoings and Equipments with damage. However, I wonder if it comes with a drawback: do the cards under La Capitan gain health? I've never been quite sure on how La Capitan's stored cards, and I thought this was enough of an edge case to ask about.</p>",
