      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-04-26T14:39:40.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm not so sure that Maria Helena's Revenge will trigger just because her ongoings are no longer a target. As the requirement is for them to destroyed, while the target has simply left play.</p><p>I think generally when a card is put under another card it no longer has text, it's supposed to be essentially a blank card. If they still have HP than Final Breath and Battle Forged could be stuck hitting and destroying the same Bee Bot for all eternity.</p>",
