      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/koga/{size}/2058_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-04-30T00:34:06.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Whenever I put cards under another card such as La Capitan or Haka's Savage Mana, I put them face down to show they no longer have text. They are still considered Hero, Villain, or Environment cards though and as such will trigger things like Haka's Dominion and Bunker's Ammo Drop.</p>",
